      "text": "$y = \\tan x + \\cot x$ is periodic with the period of $x = \\pi$.\nAs shown in the below graph, $y = \\tan x + \\cot x$ is a periodic function.\nThus, to find the period of the function with the period $x = \\pi$.\n\n$y = \\tan \\left(\\frac{x + \\pi}{2}\\right) + \\cot \\left(\\frac{x + \\pi}{2}\\right)$,\n$y = -\\tan x + \\cot x$.\n\n$\\therefore$ The period of $y = \\tan x + \\cot x$ is $\\boxed{\\pi}$.",
